\begin_layout Subsection
Evaluation Metrics
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Models are evaluated across standard top-
\begin_inset Formula $K$
\end_inset

 ranking metrics for 
\begin_inset Formula $K \in \{5, 10, 20\}$
\end_inset

: 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Recall@K:
\series default
 Fraction of ground-truth test items captured in top-
\begin_inset Formula $K$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Precision@K:
\series default
 Fraction of top-
\begin_inset Formula $K$
\end_inset

 recommended items relevant in test. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
NDCG@K:
\series default
 Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain with logarithmic discount 
\begin_inset Formula $\log_2(j + 1)$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
MAP@K:
\series default
 Mean Average Precision up to rank 
\begin_inset Formula $K$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
Compared Baseline Configurations
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
We evaluate seven fully specified configurations under identical catalog and test user sets: 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Popularity Baseline:
\series default
 Recommends most frequently played tracks globally in 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{D}_{\text{train}}$
\end_inset

 excluding user history 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{H}_u$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Base Implicit MSVD:
\series default
 Pure collaborative filtering model (
\begin_inset Formula $w_{\text{msvd}}=1.0$
\end_inset

). 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Tag-Fused MSVD:
\series default
 Dual stream combining MSVD and Tag TF-IDF (
\begin_inset Formula $w_{\text{msvd}}=0.5, w_{\text{tag}}=0.5$
\end_inset

). 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Temporal Recency MSVD:
\series default
 Dual stream combining MSVD and exponential temporal decay (
\begin_inset Formula $w_{\text{msvd}}=0.5, w_{\text{temp}}=0.5$
\end_inset

). 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Fixed Tag + Temporal (Unnormalized):
\series default
 Direct additive combination of unnormalized collaborative, tag, and temporal scores. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Global Normalized Arbiter:
\series default
 Proposed architecture with per-user MSVD min-max normalization and global weights 
\begin_inset Formula $(0.20, 0.30, 0.50)$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

\series bold
Adaptive User Arbiter:
\series default
 Dynamic per-user stream weighting based on user interaction count and profile entropy. 
\end_layout

