\end_inset

 (Relative drop of 
\begin_inset Formula $-80.898\%$
\end_inset

). 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Ablation without Tag Stream:
\series default
 
\begin_inset Formula $\text{NDCG@10} = 0.006370$
\end_inset

 (Relative drop of 
\begin_inset Formula $-14.078\%$
\end_inset

). 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Ablation without Temporal Stream:
\series default
 
\begin_inset Formula $\text{NDCG@10} = 0.007414$
\end_inset

 (Primary contribution realized at top ranks @5 and @10). 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This ablation demonstrates that implicit collaborative MSVD provides the indispensable anchor for candidate ranking, while the tag and temporal streams provide crucial complementary refinement.
\end_layout

